1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Over the past two years, engineering teams discovered a painful truth:

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:22,000
scaling prompt length does not scale autonomous capability. Single-prompt architectures inevitably break down.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Production AI agents are distributed state machines built on deterministic tool protocols.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:58,000
A common mistake is treating the model context window as working memory.

5
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Production architectures decouple memory into ephemeral turns, semantic stores, and append-only ledgers.

6
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Tools must be defined as typed remote procedure calls with hardware-isolated execution boundaries.

7
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Immutable checkpoint ledgers bound crash recovery time by resuming execution from the latest valid state snapshot.

8
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:40,000
If a step fails, the system rolls back cleanly instead of restarting from scratch.

9
00:02:40,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Empirical benchmarks show supervisor-worker hierarchies prevent circular debate deadlocks and consistently outperform flat peer swarms.

10
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:30,000
The supervisor holds the state machine and evaluates deliverables against strict schema contracts.

11
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Subjective self-evaluation is the most dangerous trap in autonomous agent deployment.

12
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Production pipelines rely on non-negotiable deterministic quality gates: unit tests, integration tests, and frame decoding.

13
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Without strict token budget circuits, runaway retry loops burn through API spend without resolving underlying failures.

14
00:04:45,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Production architectures implement per-stage ceilings, retry limits, and tiered model routing.

15
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:35,000
Building production AI agents is about disciplined software engineering scaffolding around foundation models.

16
00:05:35,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Shadow dry-runs prove zero mutations and zero unverified side effects before live release.
